# Implementation Plan - Sprint 5.0: Expanded Fungible Fallbacks

Refactor the Friday Night Draw fallback system in `studio/models/draw.py` to eliminate AI genre bias by replacing hardcoded single placeholder strings with rich, randomized pools of highly fungible constraints (`FALLBACK_NAMES`, `FALLBACK_TRAITS`, `FALLBACK_PROPS`, `FALLBACK_LINES`).

