# Phase 1 Implementation Plan: 48HFP-Studio (Core CLI & Global State)

Develop Phase 1 of **48HFP-Studio**, a terminal-native AI co-pilot CLI for short film festival pre-production. Phase 1 focuses on setting up the Typer/Rich CLI scaffolding and building persistent global team configuration management using PyYAML and Pydantic.

