   - **Show Active**: Run `python main.py constraints show-active` and `python main.py info` to confirm global active state tracking.
   - **Delete**: Run `python main.py constraints delete test_logistical --type logistical --force`.
3. Verify YAML storage files created under `/home/andrew/48HFP App/constraints/`.

