# Phase 1 Implementation Plan: 48HFP-Studio (Core CLI & Global State)

Develop Phase 1 of **48HFP-Studio**, a terminal-native AI co-pilot CLI for short film festival pre-production. Phase 1 focuses on setting up the Typer/Rich CLI scaffolding and building persistent global team configuration management using PyYAML and Pydantic.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Profile storage location is defaulted to `~/.48hfp_profile.yaml` as per specifications.
> - The CLI will support both interactive configuration onboarding (`48hfp config setup`) and quick viewing (`48hfp config show`).
> - The data schema uses **Pydantic v2** for validation and **PyYAML** for human-readable YAML persistence.

## Open Questions

- None at present; specifications for Phase 1 (Sprint 1.1 and Sprint 1.2) are fully covered in `PROJECT_INSTRUCTIONS.md`.

