# Phase 2 Implementation Plan: 48HFP-Studio (The Unified Constraint System)

Phase 2 builds the modular logic to handle user-defined Logistical and Creative Constraint Sets. It implements Sprint 2.1 (Data Models & Persistence Storage) and Sprint 2.2 (CLI Constraint Management CRUD & Active Set State Tracking).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Constraint YAML files will be stored in `/home/andrew/48HFP App/constraints/logistical/` and `/home/andrew/48HFP App/constraints/creative/`.
> - Active constraint selections (`active_logistical_constraint` and `active_creative_constraint`) will be tracked within the global team profile (`~/.48hfp_profile.yaml`) to ensure persistent state across CLI sessions.
> - On first run, default starter constraint templates (`interior_indie_crew` for logistical, `a24_slow_burn` for creative) will be automatically seeded for instant out-of-the-box usability.

## Open Questions

- None; the constraints specification aligns directly with Section 4.B and 4.C of `PROJECT_INSTRUCTIONS.md`.

## Proposed Changes

### Data Models & Schemas

#### [NEW] [studio/models/constraints.py](file:///home/andrew/48HFP%20App/studio/models/constraints.py)
Define Pydantic v2 schemas:
- `CharacterDetail`: Name, actor traits, wardrobe, notes.
- `LogisticalConstraint`:
  - `name`: Unique identifier slug (alphanumeric, dashes, underscores).
  - `description`: Overview description.
  - `locations`: List of filming location types (e.g., Interior, Restaurant, Night).
  - `sub_locations`: List of specific sub-locations (e.g., Dining Room, Kitchen, Restroom).
  - `location_details`: Long text field detailing layout, lighting, restrictions.
  - `main_character_details`: Extended character detail model.
  - `other_characters`: List of `CharacterDetail` objects.
  - `props_and_dialogue`: List of available props and running dialogue elements.
  - `created_at` / `updated_at`: ISO timestamp strings.
- `CreativeConstraint`:
  - `name`: Unique identifier slug.
  - `description`: Overview description.
  - `scenarios`: List of short pre-baked story scenarios.
  - `core_philosophy`: Thematic spine and directorial vision.
  - `scene_economy`: Pacing directives (e.g. long takes, frantic cuts).
  - `progression_and_climax`: Narrative structure guidelines.
  - `visuals_and_post`: Color grading, scoring style, visual effect limits.
  - `created_at` / `updated_at`: ISO timestamp strings.

#### [MODIFY] [studio/models/profile.py](file:///home/andrew/48HFP%20App/studio/models/profile.py)
Extend `TeamProfile` schema with active constraint tracking:
- `active_logistical_constraint: Optional[str] = None`
- `active_creative_constraint: Optional[str] = None`

---

### Constraint Storage & File Management

#### [NEW] [studio/utils/constraint_store.py](file:///home/andrew/48HFP%20App/studio/utils/constraint_store.py)
Implement file management utility:
- Manage `/home/andrew/48HFP App/constraints/logistical` and `constraints/creative`.
- Implement `save_logistical_constraint`, `load_logistical_constraint`, `list_logistical_constraints`, `delete_logistical_constraint`.
- Implement `save_creative_constraint`, `load_creative_constraint`, `list_creative_constraints`, `delete_creative_constraint`.
